WEBVTT

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:02.920
The Digital World,

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:06.070
a world inhabited by unusual 
creatures called Digimon.

00:00:06.070 --> 00:00:09.950
It has been conquered 
by the evil Bagra Army

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:14.550
and divided into seven Kingdoms 
ruled by seven Death Generals.

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:18.230
Taiki Kudou has leapt 
into these seven Kingdoms

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:22.090
along with his partner, 
Shoutmon, to save the Digimon.

00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:25.700
This is the story of the 
friendship and adventures

00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:28.540
shared by Taiki, his 
friends, and the Digimon.

00:01:51.220 --> 00:01:55.260
The Digital World has been 
taken over by Bagramon,

00:01:55.260 --> 00:01:58.070
the evil leader of the Bagra Army.

00:02:00.080 --> 00:02:06.550
But out of the seven powerful Death 
Generals, our team, Xros Heart,

00:02:06.550 --> 00:02:08.530
has defeated Dorbickmon the Fire Fury

00:02:08.530 --> 00:02:11.190
and NeoVamdemon the Moon Light,

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:13.220
and now we've moved on 
to the third Kingdom.

00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:24.740
<b>Power is Absorbed!</b>

00:02:17.020 --> 00:02:24.740
<b>The Hunters of Honey Land</b>

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:22.060
Power is Absorbed! 
The Hunters of Honey Land!

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:36.630
Thanks, Taiki.

00:02:37.080 --> 00:02:39.140
Don't let your guard down, Shoutmon.

00:02:39.140 --> 00:02:40.180
Okay.

00:02:43.420 --> 00:02:46.260
So, what kind of Kingdom is this?

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:48.050
A flower field?

00:02:48.780 --> 00:02:50.070
It's so pretty.

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:54.890
It really is! You love 
flowers, don't you, Nene?

00:02:56.810 --> 00:02:59.550
They smell sweet, like honey.

00:02:59.550 --> 00:03:01.090
Beautiful place.

00:03:01.530 --> 00:03:02.360
But...

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:05.130
I bet there's a Bagra Army Death General

00:03:05.130 --> 00:03:07.770
gathering negative energy here, too.

00:03:07.770 --> 00:03:10.450
We'll defeat him for sure!

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:19.680
They're all stumbling around...

00:03:21.550 --> 00:03:22.980
What's wrong with them?

00:03:24.350 --> 00:03:26.250
What's happening?

00:03:27.050 --> 00:03:29.020
Stop!

00:03:29.390 --> 00:03:30.460
That voice...

00:03:30.460 --> 00:03:31.160
Let's go!

00:03:31.160 --> 00:03:32.520
Yeah!

00:03:36.270 --> 00:03:37.350
Lilamon!

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:47.110
What is that sound?

00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:48.640
I can't move...

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:50.980
What are you doing, Dorulumon?!

00:03:50.980 --> 00:03:53.140
It's dangerous to be in the 
path of these sound waves!

00:03:53.140 --> 00:03:55.550
It'll paralyze you!

00:03:57.780 --> 00:04:00.080
So it's a wavelength 
that Digimon can't stand?

00:04:00.450 --> 00:04:01.870
Why, you...

00:04:05.990 --> 00:04:07.780
Reload, Greymon!

00:04:07.780 --> 00:04:10.530
Rock Damashi!

00:04:12.170 --> 00:04:13.830
Mega Flame!

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:19.470
Are you okay, Lilamon?

00:04:19.910 --> 00:04:21.310
Sparrowmon!

00:04:21.310 --> 00:04:22.840
I can move now, Nene.

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:25.410
So it <i>was</i> the sound causing it!

00:04:31.240 --> 00:04:32.490
Taiki...

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:36.670
Who interferes with me?

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:38.840
Where's that voice coming from?

00:04:44.040 --> 00:04:45.860
What's that tiny little thing?

00:04:45.860 --> 00:04:49.200
I am the Death General of Honey Land,

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:51.000
Lord Zamielmon.

00:04:51.000 --> 00:04:51.870
What?

00:04:52.160 --> 00:04:52.800
Him?

00:04:52.800 --> 00:04:54.410
That tiny little thing?

00:04:54.410 --> 00:04:57.410
Don't get careless just because I'm small.

00:04:57.410 --> 00:04:59.870
I'll absorb all of your power.

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:02.580
Ignitemon! Honeybeemon!

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:03.380
Get them!

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:06.380
Yes, Lord Zamielmon.

00:05:07.650 --> 00:05:10.580
No! Not that sound again!

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:12.020
We're surrounded!

00:05:12.020 --> 00:05:13.620
I'm scared!

00:05:16.860 --> 00:05:20.030
It feels like all my 
strength is leaving me...

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:27.040
I feel so weak...

00:05:28.610 --> 00:05:30.040
Are you guys okay?

00:05:30.040 --> 00:05:32.570
Yes, yes, very good.

00:05:38.680 --> 00:05:40.350
Is that another enemy?

00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:53.900
Mervamon! Interfering again?

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:55.070
Oh, well.

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:57.520
I've got my DigiHoney now.

00:05:57.520 --> 00:05:59.440
Withdraw!

00:05:59.440 --> 00:06:00.590
You're not going anywhere!

00:06:01.190 --> 00:06:03.110
Ignitemon, stop her!

00:06:03.110 --> 00:06:03.980
Y-Yes, sir!

00:06:05.080 --> 00:06:08.110
Stop interfering with Lord Zamielmon!

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:10.030
Get out of my way!

00:06:24.430 --> 00:06:26.360
Xros Heart,

00:06:26.360 --> 00:06:27.970
I'm so glad to see you all again.

00:06:28.860 --> 00:06:31.870
Hey, where are those two who 
did the Love Love Dance?

00:06:31.870 --> 00:06:36.210
I was the only one who could 
come back to the Digital World.

00:06:36.210 --> 00:06:38.380
Stingmon isn't with you?

00:06:38.810 --> 00:06:39.900
Well...

00:06:41.100 --> 00:06:43.350
Lilamon, are these friends of yours?

00:06:43.350 --> 00:06:47.820
Yes. They're fighting 
against the Bagra Army.

00:06:47.820 --> 00:06:49.830
Is that so? Good.

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:53.150
Then you should all follow me.

00:06:54.990 --> 00:06:55.920
Let's go.

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:03.170
She's sort of pushy.

00:07:03.530 --> 00:07:05.500
Let's go with her for now.

00:07:20.000 --> 00:07:21.990
This is delicious DigiHoney.

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:27.590
It's a mass of fear and despair, after all.

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:33.340
My bees can make honey from 
concentrated negative power.

00:07:33.340 --> 00:07:36.330
If I present him with negative 
power of such high purity,

00:07:36.330 --> 00:07:41.240
Lord DarkKnightmon is 
sure to be quite pleased.

00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:45.640
Lord Zamielmon, don't we have 
enough DigiHoney already?

00:07:46.370 --> 00:07:48.410
Not nearly enough.

00:07:48.410 --> 00:07:52.110
All the Digimon of Honey Land 
can't walk straight anymore.

00:07:53.140 --> 00:07:56.450
Are you trying to defy me, Ignitemon?

00:07:58.820 --> 00:08:02.690
You just keep quiet and do as I say!

00:08:02.690 --> 00:08:04.140
I understand.

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:06.030
Please forgive me.

00:08:06.880 --> 00:08:09.740
Lord Zamielmon.

00:08:10.880 --> 00:08:13.710
I have received word that 
the ones who defeated

00:08:13.710 --> 00:08:16.640
two Death Generals have 
arrived in Honey Land.

00:08:16.640 --> 00:08:18.780
The ones I met earlier?

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:24.900
It could be fun to take 
DigiHoney from them.

00:08:24.900 --> 00:08:27.590
I'll take every last drop.

00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:39.060
This is our hideout.

00:08:39.910 --> 00:08:42.170
A Digimon's shell?

00:08:48.020 --> 00:08:49.720
Stingmon!

00:08:49.720 --> 00:08:51.210
Taiki... and all of you...

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:52.680
What happened to you?

00:08:53.050 --> 00:08:56.670
The Honeybeemon sucked out all his power.

00:08:56.670 --> 00:09:00.760
They keep Digimon just barely alive,

00:09:00.760 --> 00:09:03.000
so they can hunt them over and over.

00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:04.980
The more we suffer,

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:08.560
the more concentrated 
DigiHoney they can make.

00:09:08.560 --> 00:09:12.930
Stingmon stood to fight against Zamielmon,

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:15.830
and had most of his power stolen...

00:09:16.420 --> 00:09:20.240
Stop crying, Lilamon. 
Tears don't suit a woman.

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:23.170
I swear I will defeat Zamielmon.

00:09:23.170 --> 00:09:26.480
Now this is a lady we can depend on!

00:09:27.150 --> 00:09:31.020
Eat, to make up for the power you've lost.

00:09:31.550 --> 00:09:33.820
Wow! DigiNoir!

00:09:33.820 --> 00:09:36.470
Once you've eaten, I'm going 
to attack Zamielmon's castle.

00:09:36.470 --> 00:09:37.970
You will all come with me.

00:09:38.890 --> 00:09:40.280
You've got guts.

00:09:40.280 --> 00:09:41.930
But how are we going to attack?

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:44.450
I will attack from the front.

00:09:44.450 --> 00:09:46.280
You all will back me up.

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:48.330
You're giving us orders?

00:09:48.330 --> 00:09:50.940
And you think you can defeat 
him with a frontal assault?

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:52.770
I <i>will</i> defeat him!

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:55.090
You have the enthusiasm, but no strategy?

00:09:55.090 --> 00:09:57.070
You have such a cute face,

00:09:57.070 --> 00:10:00.380
yet such a smart mouth, don't you, boy?

00:10:01.880 --> 00:10:03.620
I can't follow you.

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:05.790
I'll go my own way.

00:10:06.520 --> 00:10:07.720
Kiriha...

00:10:08.670 --> 00:10:10.660
Such a short-tempered boy.

00:10:10.660 --> 00:10:14.360
Talk about bold, 
treating Kiriha like a little boy...

00:10:14.360 --> 00:10:16.790
You've just lost us a valuable ally.

00:10:17.240 --> 00:10:19.330
No need to chase after those who run.

00:10:19.330 --> 00:10:20.770
He's our teammate!

00:10:20.770 --> 00:10:23.170
Don't talk back to me, little lady.

00:10:23.170 --> 00:10:24.740
Little lady?!

00:10:28.140 --> 00:10:31.830
Only those who are up to 
following me shall do so.

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:33.820
Who would follow you?!

00:10:34.710 --> 00:10:35.630
Taiki!

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:37.940
I can't turn my back on them.

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:41.730
And I can't sit around watching 
Stingmon and the others

00:10:41.730 --> 00:10:43.350
continue to have their power sucked out.

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:46.090
I'm going to defeat this 
Kingdom's Death General.

00:10:46.090 --> 00:10:47.760
Thank you, Taiki!

00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:48.240
Whoa!

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:52.250
I like you.

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:54.590
I'll appoint you as my 
attack force leader.

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:55.300
Huh?

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.210
Don't make that decision on your own!

00:10:57.940 --> 00:11:02.510
Nene, let's work with Mervamon 
to defeat the Death General.

00:11:04.530 --> 00:11:06.210
Fine.

00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:18.550
Follow after me.

00:11:19.390 --> 00:11:21.090
Something about her bugs me!

00:11:21.090 --> 00:11:23.730
It's all for the sake of 
defeating the Death General.

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:26.170
Let's follow Mervamon for now.

00:11:27.300 --> 00:11:28.940
I guess we have no choice.

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:35.040
Oops, that didn't go well.

00:11:36.350 --> 00:11:37.880
Is this the time to be laughing?

00:11:38.330 --> 00:11:39.180
Let's go!

00:11:40.610 --> 00:11:42.310
Charge!

00:11:42.740 --> 00:11:44.820
She's seriously making a frontal attack?!

00:11:45.150 --> 00:11:46.950
Don't you have more of a strategy?

00:11:46.950 --> 00:11:49.790
All you need to do is back me up!

00:11:49.790 --> 00:11:51.760
Your courage is admirable, 
but that's reckless!

00:11:53.130 --> 00:11:56.160
We have to attack before 
they can steal our power!

00:11:56.160 --> 00:11:58.120
Now, advance!

00:11:58.120 --> 00:12:00.180
She really is pushy.

00:12:00.180 --> 00:12:04.540
Is it me, or are we completely 
under Mervamon's thumb?

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:07.130
Here they come!

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:09.370
It's them again!

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:10.360
We'll be stung!

00:12:13.660 --> 00:12:15.210
Ouch!

00:12:16.650 --> 00:12:18.120
Calm down, everyone!

00:12:18.120 --> 00:12:19.750
That's right! Don't fear them!

00:12:19.750 --> 00:12:22.850
Fear and despair fuel them!

00:12:24.460 --> 00:12:26.550
Everyone, stick together!

00:12:26.550 --> 00:12:28.230
We attack all at once!

00:12:28.230 --> 00:12:31.050
Dorulu Tornado!

00:12:33.770 --> 00:12:37.070
Heavy Speaker!

00:12:37.580 --> 00:12:40.320
Soul Crusher!

00:12:43.700 --> 00:12:44.740
That was nothing!

00:12:45.060 --> 00:12:46.710
You're not bad.

00:12:46.710 --> 00:12:48.580
Same to you.

00:12:49.380 --> 00:12:51.230
I'm sorry, Nene!

00:12:51.940 --> 00:12:53.430
Don't worry about it.

00:12:53.430 --> 00:12:55.160
You okay, little lady?

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:56.380
I'm fine.

00:12:56.380 --> 00:12:58.320
Hold on. I'll treat it.

00:13:00.500 --> 00:13:01.950
This will disinfect the wound.

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:06.300
That should do it.

00:13:10.180 --> 00:13:11.770
Hold it! You won't get away!

00:13:17.670 --> 00:13:19.240
Ignitemon...

00:13:19.240 --> 00:13:23.800
Please stop defying 
Lord Zamielmon, sister!

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:25.550
Sister?

00:13:25.550 --> 00:13:28.480
Huh? Sister? You're siblings?!

00:13:29.460 --> 00:13:30.850
That's right.

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:32.760
He's my younger brother.

00:13:33.490 --> 00:13:34.730
Younger brother...

00:13:35.470 --> 00:13:39.030
But he's helping Zamielmon 
hunt other Digimon!

00:13:39.030 --> 00:13:42.600
This world is under the control 
of the Bagra Army now!

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:46.840
What choice do we have but 
to side with the strong?

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:48.590
It's useless to fight them.

00:13:48.590 --> 00:13:49.740
Coward!

00:13:50.110 --> 00:13:52.110
I can't defy the Death General!

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:54.530
If we fight together,

00:13:54.530 --> 00:13:56.890
we can defeat the Bagra Army!

00:14:02.100 --> 00:14:05.250
We can't defeat them.

00:14:05.250 --> 00:14:06.720
You've got that right.

00:14:08.630 --> 00:14:09.960
Zamielmon!

00:14:10.320 --> 00:14:13.210
Resistance is futile, Mervamon.

00:14:13.210 --> 00:14:15.600
Your brother is right.

00:14:15.600 --> 00:14:16.610
Quiet!

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:18.270
Sister!

00:14:27.370 --> 00:14:29.350
He's hard to fight because he's so small!

00:14:33.760 --> 00:14:38.920
Ignitemon, stop them all in 
their tracks with your power.

00:14:38.920 --> 00:14:40.560
Your sister, and these fools

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:43.100
who claim to have defeated 
the Death Generals.

00:14:43.100 --> 00:14:46.360
Steal all the power you can out of them.

00:14:52.730 --> 00:14:55.520
Did you not hear my order?

00:14:56.670 --> 00:14:59.510
I understand, Lord Zamielmon.

00:15:01.980 --> 00:15:05.370
Stop working with him!

00:15:05.370 --> 00:15:07.590
Even if you are my brother,

00:15:07.590 --> 00:15:10.390
if you insist on continuing 
to hurt everyone...

00:15:10.390 --> 00:15:11.620
I will take you down!

00:15:13.990 --> 00:15:16.700
I won't show mercy just 
because you're my brother!

00:15:17.330 --> 00:15:18.830
That's...

00:15:21.040 --> 00:15:22.940
Now that sounds amusing.

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:26.700
I simply must see this battle 
between brother and sister.

00:15:28.180 --> 00:15:32.910
But as you are now, the difference 
in strength is too great.

00:15:32.910 --> 00:15:35.010
GrandisKuwagamon!

00:15:39.020 --> 00:15:40.870
A Darkness Loader?

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:41.720
What are you going to do?!

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:45.040
Honeybeemon! GrandisKuwagamon!

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:47.560
Forced DigiXros!

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:09.530
Get on, Ignitemon.

00:16:09.530 --> 00:16:11.070
Get on and fight your sister.

00:16:12.750 --> 00:16:14.950
Brother and sister, fighting?

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:17.890
What's the deal with this Zamielmon?!

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:18.570
I can't forgive him!

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:23.220
What's wrong? Can't you hear what 
your Death General is saying?

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:26.830
I will fight my sister.

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:29.310
Now, go!

00:16:31.940 --> 00:16:34.070
Mervamon, what are you gonna do?

00:16:34.070 --> 00:16:35.470
Are you going to fight your brother?

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:36.770
Yes.

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:38.440
Don't interfere.

00:16:38.440 --> 00:16:40.180
You can't... Mervamon!

00:16:44.570 --> 00:16:46.260
Forgive me, sister!

00:16:46.260 --> 00:16:47.800
I have no choice!

00:17:00.970 --> 00:17:02.630
Stop, Mervamon!

00:17:02.630 --> 00:17:04.520
Why must you fight your brother?!

00:17:16.810 --> 00:17:18.150
Mervamon...

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:21.160
He was an adorable little brother...

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:24.560
until Honey Land was taken 
over by the Death General.

00:17:25.110 --> 00:17:28.240
But I can't watch the 
citizens of Honey Land

00:17:28.240 --> 00:17:30.630
be turned into living 
husks at the hands of

00:17:30.630 --> 00:17:34.200
my brother and Zamielmon any longer.

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:36.650
I'd rather stop him with my own hands!

00:17:38.640 --> 00:17:41.730
Sadness, anger, pain...

00:17:41.730 --> 00:17:44.640
You're overflowing with 
negative power, Mervamon!

00:17:49.010 --> 00:17:51.960
Now, little brother Ignitemon,

00:17:51.960 --> 00:17:55.350
draw all the power you 
can from your sister.

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:56.450
I'm sorry, sister!

00:18:02.630 --> 00:18:03.960
Mervamon!

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:08.070
Sparrowmon, fly with me.

00:18:08.070 --> 00:18:08.900
What?

00:18:08.900 --> 00:18:10.540
Let me do this, Taiki.

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:11.450
Nene...

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:13.070
What are you gonna do?!

00:18:18.600 --> 00:18:19.940
Okay.

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:24.450
Mervamon!

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:26.150
Everyone, protect Nene!

00:18:26.150 --> 00:18:27.370
Got it!

00:18:28.020 --> 00:18:28.890
Okay!

00:18:28.890 --> 00:18:30.520
Random Laser!

00:18:31.760 --> 00:18:33.390
Wing Edge!

00:18:35.060 --> 00:18:35.790
What are you...

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:41.310
Stop fighting!

00:18:41.310 --> 00:18:43.200
Don't you understand 
how your sister feels?!

00:18:46.250 --> 00:18:46.900
Let me go!

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:48.460
If you don't understand,

00:18:48.460 --> 00:18:50.190
I'll stop you myself if I have to!

00:18:52.460 --> 00:18:55.210
Mervamon, I've captured your brother!

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:58.080
We have to fight with all we've got!

00:18:58.080 --> 00:19:00.280
What are you doing, Ignitemon?!

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:02.630
A DigiXros made by hearts coming together

00:19:02.630 --> 00:19:05.340
will never lose to a forced DigiXros!

00:19:05.340 --> 00:19:07.360
Mervamon! Sparrowmon!

00:19:07.360 --> 00:19:08.030
Let's do it!

00:19:08.610 --> 00:19:10.130
Okay, Nene!

00:19:13.870 --> 00:19:15.470
Mervamon!

00:19:17.950 --> 00:19:19.300
Sparrowmon!

00:19:24.990 --> 00:19:26.390
DigiXros!

00:19:27.610 --> 00:19:29.220
DigiXros!

00:19:47.350 --> 00:19:49.200
JetMervamon!

00:19:55.670 --> 00:20:00.450
I will not lose to someone who 
makes other suffer for fun!

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:08.080
I will protect the peace in this Kingdom!

00:20:10.150 --> 00:20:11.990
Heartbreak Shot!

00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:23.220
We did it.

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:25.170
That's the true strength that comes

00:20:25.170 --> 00:20:27.980
from Mervamon's and our 
hearts put together.

00:20:31.840 --> 00:20:33.650
Curse you!

00:20:43.410 --> 00:20:44.520
Sister...

00:20:47.650 --> 00:20:49.460
Ignitemon.

00:20:52.160 --> 00:20:55.020
I'm sorry. I was wrong.

00:20:55.960 --> 00:20:59.440
Helping a monster like him, 
just because I was scared...

00:21:00.880 --> 00:21:02.320
It's fine.

00:21:03.100 --> 00:21:06.600
You'll fight by our side now.

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:07.710
With me.

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:14.650
Thanks, Nene.

00:21:15.310 --> 00:21:17.770
You're pretty reckless yourself.

00:21:18.690 --> 00:21:20.740
I couldn't just sit around watching.

00:21:22.180 --> 00:21:24.100
I have a younger brother, too.

00:21:25.760 --> 00:21:29.870
Nene came to the Digital World 
looking for her brother.

00:21:30.270 --> 00:21:32.200
Then, where is your brother?

00:21:35.390 --> 00:21:38.640
I still don't know where he is.

00:21:40.330 --> 00:21:41.780
I see.

00:21:42.520 --> 00:21:44.800
But I will find him.

00:21:44.800 --> 00:21:46.380
No matter what.

00:21:58.550 --> 00:22:02.330
I won't forgive those humans.

00:22:02.870 --> 00:22:07.170
I'll get them back for this.

00:22:07.170 --> 00:22:09.690
<b>To Be Continued</b>

