00:22:27.130 --> 00:22:28.380
LadyDevimon.

00:22:28.380 --> 00:22:30.760
Her special attack is Darkness Wave.

00:22:30.760 --> 00:22:33.590
I wonder if she can fly 
with those tattered wings.

00:22:33.590 --> 00:22:36.600
I bet they're tattered 
because she's a poor flier!

00:22:36.600 --> 00:22:39.570
You should get those fixed!

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:45.940
Zamielmon's a powerful foe who's 
so fast, we can't land a hit!

00:22:45.940 --> 00:22:47.800
How are we supposed to defeat him?!

00:22:47.800 --> 00:22:51.010
Hang in there until he 
shows his true form!

00:22:51.010 --> 00:22:52.120
Digimon Xros Wars!

00:22:52.120 --> 00:22:54.400
